{"seq":2,"slug":"generators-shrinking","title":"生成器与收缩器机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/foundations/generators-shrinking","wordCount":1592,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"生成器与收缩器机制\">生成器与收缩器机制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>生成器（Generator）负责自动构造满足类型约束的测试输入；收缩器（Shrinker）负责将触发失败的反例最小化为最简形式。两者共同构成属性测试的执行引擎——生成器决定&quot;探索什么&quot;，收缩器决定&quot;报告什么&quot;。现代框架采用字节流解释模型统一两者的数据表示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生成器的设计哲学\">生成器的设计哲学</h2><p>生成器（Generator / Strategy / Arbitrary）是属性测试的动力引擎——它负责自动生成满足类型约束的随机输入。生成器的质量直接决定了属性测试的有效性：一个差的生成器可能永远无法触达 bug 所在的输入空间区域。</p>\n<p>生成器的核心设计原则是<strong>组合性</strong>（Composability）：复杂类型的生成器由简单类型的生成器组合而成。这与代数数据类型（ADT）的构造方式一一对应：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>ADT 构造方式</th>\n<th>生成器组合方式</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>积类型（Product）</td>\n<td><code>tuple</code> / <code>builds</code></td>\n<td>结构体的每个字段独立生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>和类型（Sum）</td>\n<td><code>one_of</code> / <code>frequency</code></td>\n<td>按权重选择一个变体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>递归类型</td>\n<td><code>recursive</code> / <code>deferred</code></td>\n<td>树、链表等递归结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>约束类型</td>\n<td><code>filter</code> / <code>assume</code></td>\n<td>满足不变量的子集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>映射类型</td>\n<td><code>map</code> / <code>flatmap</code></td>\n<td>对生成值做变换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>以 Hypothesis 为例，一个复合生成器的构建过程如下：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from hypothesis import strategies as st&#10;&#10;# 原子生成器&#10;ages = st.integers(min_value=0, max_value=150)&#10;names = st.text(min_size=1, max_size=64,&#10;               alphabet=st.characters(whitelist_categories=(&quot;L&quot;, &quot;N&quot;)))&#10;&#10;# 组合生成器（积类型）&#10;@st.composite&#10;def user_strategy(draw):&#10;    name = draw(names)&#10;    age = draw(ages)&#10;    email = draw(st.emails())&#10;    return User(name=name, age=age, email=email)&#10;&#10;# 递归生成器&#10;json_values = st.recursive(&#10;    base=st.one_of(st.none(), st.booleans(), st.integers(), st.text()),&#10;    extend=lambda children: st.one_of(&#10;        st.lists(children),&#10;        st.dictionaries(st.text(min_size=1), children)&#10;    ),&#10;    max_leaves=50&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hypothesis </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> strategies </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> st</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 原子生成器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ages </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> st.integers(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">min_value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">150</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">names </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> st.text(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">min_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">               alphabet</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">st.characters(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">whitelist_categories</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"L\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"N\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 组合生成器（积类型）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@st.composite</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> user_strategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(draw):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> draw(names)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> draw(ages)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    email </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> draw(st.emails())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> User(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">age</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">age, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">email</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">email)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 递归生成器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">json_values </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> st.recursive(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    base</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">st.one_of(st.none(), st.booleans(), st.integers(), st.text()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    extend</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> children: st.one_of(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        st.lists(children),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        st.dictionaries(st.text(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">min_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), children)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    max_leaves</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"生成器的内部执行模型\">生成器的内部执行模型</h2><p>生成器并非简单的随机数生成器（RNG）。现代属性测试框架的生成器建立在<strong>字节流解释</strong>模型之上——生成过程从一个随机字节序列中&quot;消费&quot;字节来做出选择：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[随机字节流] --&gt; B[生成器解释器]&#10;    B --&gt; C[消费字节做选择]&#10;    C --&gt; D[构造结构化值]&#10;    D --&gt; E[生成的测试输入]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; F[记录选择路径]&#10;    F --&gt; G[用于收缩]\">flowchart LR\n    A[随机字节流] --&gt; B[生成器解释器]\n    B --&gt; C[消费字节做选择]\n    C --&gt; D[构造结构化值]\n    D --&gt; E[生成的测试输入]\n\n    B --&gt; F[记录选择路径]\n    F --&gt; G[用于收缩]</pre><p>这种基于字节流的模型有几个关键优势：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>统一收缩接口</strong>：收缩操作变成对字节流的简化，无需为每种类型实现专门的收缩器</li>\n<li><strong>可重放性</strong>：同一字节流总是生成同一输出值，支持确定性回放</li>\n<li><strong>与模糊测试的桥梁</strong>：覆盖率引导的模糊器（AFL、LibFuzzer）本质上就是在变异字节流——这使得属性测试与模糊测试可以共享同一引擎</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Hypothesis 从版本 4.0 开始采用了这种&quot;集成收缩&quot;（Integrated Shrinking）模型，也被称为&quot;内部收缩&quot;——生成和收缩共享同一数据表示。这与 QuickCheck 原始的&quot;外部收缩&quot;模型形成对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>外部收缩（QuickCheck 风格）</th>\n<th>内部收缩（Hypothesis 风格）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>收缩器定义位置</td>\n<td>每种类型单独定义</td>\n<td>由生成器自动导出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组合行为</td>\n<td>需手动组合收缩器</td>\n<td>自动正确组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>filter</code> 后收缩</td>\n<td>可能生成无效值</td>\n<td>始终满足过滤条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>flatmap</code> 后收缩</td>\n<td>困难，容易打破依赖</td>\n<td>自动保持依赖关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>用户负担重</td>\n<td>框架负担重</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"收缩器的工作原理\">收缩器的工作原理</h2><p>当属性被反驳（找到一个使属性为假的输入）时，原始反例通常是一个庞大、难以理解的随机值。收缩器（Shrinker）的任务是将这个反例<strong>自动最小化</strong>为满足失败条件的最小输入。</p>\n<p>收缩的核心算法可以形式化为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>shrink</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>false</mtext><mo>∧</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>smaller</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{shrink}(x_0) = \\min\\{x \\mid P(x) = \\text{false} \\wedge x \\in \\text{smaller}(x_0)\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">shrink</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">false</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">smaller</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>smaller</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{smaller}(x_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">smaller</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是所有比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> &quot;更小&quot;的候选值集合。&quot;更小&quot;的定义因类型而异：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>整数：绝对值更小，趋向 0</li>\n<li>字符串：更短，字符更接近 &#39;a&#39;</li>\n<li>列表：更短，元素更小</li>\n<li>树：更浅，子节点更少</li>\n</ul>\n<p>收缩过程是一个迭代搜索：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def shrink(counterexample, property_check):&#10;    current = counterexample&#10;    while True:&#10;        candidates = generate_smaller(current)&#10;        found_smaller = False&#10;        for candidate in candidates:&#10;            if not property_check(candidate):  # 属性仍然失败&#10;                current = candidate&#10;                found_smaller = True&#10;                break&#10;        if not found_smaller:&#10;            return current  # 无法进一步收缩，返回最小反例\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> shrink</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(counterexample, property_check):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counterexample</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        candidates </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> generate_smaller(current)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        found_smaller </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> candidate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> candidates:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> property_check(candidate):  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 属性仍然失败</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> candidate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                found_smaller </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> True</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> found_smaller:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 无法进一步收缩，返回最小反例</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一个典型的收缩效果：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"原始反例: [847, -2941, 0, 15, 8826, -1, 42, 993, 0, -77, 1204]&#10;收缩后:   [0, -1]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>原始反例: [847, -2941, 0, 15, 8826, -1, 42, 993, 0, -77, 1204]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>收缩后:   [0, -1]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>框架可能执行了数百次尝试才将 11 个元素的列表收缩为 2 个元素——但由此节省的调试时间是巨大的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生成器的覆盖策略\">生成器的覆盖策略</h2><p>均匀随机生成并非最优策略。为了最大化发现 bug 的概率，现代生成器采用多种覆盖增强技术：</p>\n<p><strong>边界偏置</strong>：在数值范围的边界处增加采样密度。例如，整数生成器会以更高概率生成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>MAX_INT</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>MIN_INT</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0, 1, -1, \\text{MAX\\_INT}, \\text{MIN\\_INT}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAX_INT</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MIN_INT</span></span></span></span></span></span> 等边界值。</p>\n<p><strong>规模渐进</strong>：在测试初期使用较小的输入（短列表、浅树），随着测试进展逐渐增大规模。这基于&quot;小输入先发现简单 bug，大输入再找复杂 bug&quot;的直觉。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# Hypothesis 的 settings 控制规模渐进&#10;@settings(max_examples=1000)&#10;@given(st.lists(st.integers()))&#10;def test_property(xs):&#10;    # 前几十次：短列表&#10;    # 中期：中等列表&#10;    # 后期：长列表（接近 max_size）&#10;    ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Hypothesis 的 settings 控制规模渐进</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@settings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_examples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@given</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(st.lists(st.integers()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_property</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(xs):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 前几十次：短列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 中期：中等列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 后期：长列表（接近 max_size）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ...</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>数据库记忆</strong>：Hypothesis 维护一个<strong>示例数据库</strong>（<code>.hypothesis/</code> 目录），记录历史上触发失败的输入。每次运行时优先回放这些&quot;已知坏输入&quot;，防止回归。这实现了跨运行的测试记忆。</p>\n<p><strong>目标属性（Targeted PBT）</strong>：Hypothesis 的 <code>target()</code> API 允许提供一个数值度量，框架会尝试最大化该度量。例如：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"@given(st.text())&#10;def test_parser_depth(input_text):&#10;    tree = parse(input_text)&#10;    target(tree.depth, label=&quot;parse_tree_depth&quot;)&#10;    assert tree.is_valid()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@given</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(st.text())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_parser_depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input_text):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tree </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parse(input_text)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    target(tree.depth, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"parse_tree_depth\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tree.is_valid()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这引导生成器朝&quot;解析树深度更大&quot;的方向探索——而深度大的输入更可能触发栈溢出等问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自定义生成器的最佳实践\">自定义生成器的最佳实践</h2><p>编写自定义生成器时应遵循以下原则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>先用 <code>from_type()</code> / <code>builds()</code></strong>：让框架从类型注解自动推断生成器，减少手工维护负担</li>\n<li><strong>优先 <code>filter</code> 而非手动构造</strong>：用 <code>assume()</code> 排除不满足前置条件的输入比手工确保条件更安全</li>\n<li><strong>控制递归深度</strong>：递归生成器必须设置 <code>max_leaves</code> 或等效限制，否则可能生成无限结构</li>\n<li><strong>测试生成器本身</strong>：用 <code>@example</code> 固定已知的边界值，确保生成器确实能覆盖关键区域</li>\n<li><strong>避免过度约束</strong>：生成器约束越少，探索空间越大，发现意外 bug 的可能性越高</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>生成器通过组合性设计（积类型→tuple、和类型→one_of、递归→recursive）覆盖任意复杂类型。现代框架的字节流解释模型统一了生成和收缩——使得收缩操作自动保持过滤条件和依赖关系。收缩算法通过迭代搜索找到满足失败条件的最小输入，通常可将数十元素的反例缩减到 2-3 个元素。覆盖策略（边界偏置、规模渐进、数据库记忆、目标属性）决定了生成器发现 bug 的效率。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>sibling-link</strong>: 生成器和收缩器提供了&quot;自动生成+最小化反例&quot;的机制；但属性测试的真正难点在于如何发现好的属性。见 <a href=\"property-patterns\">属性模式与不变量</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生成器与收缩器机制","id":"生成器与收缩器机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"生成器的设计哲学","id":"生成器的设计哲学"},{"level":2,"text":"生成器的内部执行模型","id":"生成器的内部执行模型"},{"level":2,"text":"收缩器的工作原理","id":"收缩器的工作原理"},{"level":2,"text":"生成器的覆盖策略","id":"生成器的覆盖策略"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义生成器的最佳实践","id":"自定义生成器的最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"属性测试的核心原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/foundations/pbt-principles"},"next":{"title":"属性模式与不变量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/foundations/property-patterns"}}